// Disparado por StatueSwitch > On Refused First Time (so na PRIMEIRA vez
// que a estatua e recusada). As recusas seguintes so piscam o bloqueador.
title: statue_blocked_first
---
Haze: It won't budge. Something's in its way.
Josh: ...the crate?
Haze: Move it and try again.
===